    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e-Way Bills:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">All packers and movers are required to generate GST e-Way Bills for goods transportation. These electronic waybills provide essential information about the consignment, such as the sender's and receiver's details, the consignment's description, and the estimated transit time.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBAA-Approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty):</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">In addition to GST e-Way Bills, reputable packers and movers like Godavari Packers and Movers Tadepalligudem may also provide IBA-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty). These documents act as a legal proof of the consignment's transportation, ensuring transparency and accountability.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Indian Railways Transport Order (IRTO):</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the goods are transported via Indian Railways, the packers and movers will prepare an Indian Railways Transport Order (IRTO) for the consignment. This document outlines the consignment details, transport mode, and transit information.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>To protect your valuable belongings during the transit, it is essential to choose a reputable packers and movers company that offers comprehensive risk coverage. Here's an overview of the coverage provided:</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>100% Declared Value IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> The best packers and movers companies, such as Godavari Packers and Movers Tadepalligudem, provide a comprehensive 100% declared value IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance. This policy covers the goods against any damage, loss, or theft during the transit, ensuring complete peace of mind.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Comprehensive Risk Coverage:</strong> In addition to IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance, some packers and movers might offer a comprehensive risk coverage for your household goods. This coverage might include additional protections against accidental collision, pilferage, and unforeseen delays, ensuring that your valuable belongings are fully insured.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Customer-Guaranteed Risk Cover:</strong> For extra assurance, some packers and movers may offer customer-guaranteed risk coverage. This means that in the unlikely event of any damage or loss during transit, the company ensures full compensation for the affected items.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<p>By choosing a trusted company like Godavari Packers and Movers Tadepalligudem, you can rest assured that all necessary paperwork and insurance policies are in place to minimize risks during transit.</p></div>
